usage: cal_diff.py [-h] [--difficulty-output DIFFICULTY_OUTPUT]
                   [--split-seed SPLIT_SEED]
                   [--replacement-policy {prefix_mean_v1}] [--causal]
                   [--no-cuda] [--base-model BASE_MODEL] [--graph-model]
                   [--nodal-attention] [--windowp WINDOWP] [--windowf WINDOWF]
                   [--lr LR] [--l2 L2] [--rec-dropout rec_dropout]
                   [--dropout dropout] [--batch-size BS] [--epochs E]
                   [--class-weight] [--active-listener]
                   [--attention ATTENTION] [--tensorboard]
                   [--graph_type GRAPH_TYPE] [--use_topic] [--alpha ALPHA]
                   [--multiheads MULTIHEADS]
                   [--graph_construct GRAPH_CONSTRUCT] [--use_gcn]
                   [--use_residue] [--multi_modal]
                   [--mm_fusion_mthd MM_FUSION_MTHD] [--modals MODALS]
                   [--av_using_lstm] [--Deep_GCN_nlayers DEEP_GCN_NLAYERS]
                   [--Dataset DATASET] [--use_speaker] [--use_modal]
                   [--norm NORM] [--testing] [--num_L NUM_L] [--num_K NUM_K]
                   [--seed SEED] [--ckpt_path CKPT_PATH]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --difficulty-output DIFFICULTY_OUTPUT
                        new immutable difficulty artifact path; default uses
                        SHA256 filename
  --split-seed SPLIT_SEED
                        data partition seed; defaults to recorded teacher
                        split seed
  --replacement-policy {prefix_mean_v1}
  --causal              use only history and current utterances
  --no-cuda             does not use GPU
  --base-model BASE_MODEL
                        base recurrent model, must be one of
                        DialogRNN/LSTM/GRU
  --graph-model         whether to use graph model after recurrent encoding
  --nodal-attention     whether to use nodal attention in graph model:
                        Equation 4,5,6 in Paper
  --windowp WINDOWP     context window size for constructing edges in graph
                        model for past utterances
  --windowf WINDOWF     context window size for constructing edges in graph
                        model for future utterances
  --lr LR               learning rate
  --l2 L2               L2 regularization weight
  --rec-dropout rec_dropout
                        rec_dropout rate
  --dropout dropout     dropout rate
  --batch-size BS       batch size
  --epochs E            number of epochs
  --class-weight        use class weights
  --active-listener     active listener
  --attention ATTENTION
                        Attention type in DialogRNN model
  --tensorboard         Enables tensorboard log
  --graph_type GRAPH_TYPE
                        relation/GCN3/DeepGCN/MMGCN/MMGCN2
  --use_topic           whether to use topic information
  --alpha ALPHA         alpha
  --multiheads MULTIHEADS
                        multiheads
  --graph_construct GRAPH_CONSTRUCT
                        single/window/fc for MMGCN2; direct/full for others
  --use_gcn             whether to combine spectral and none-spectral methods
                        or not
  --use_residue         whether to use residue information or not
  --multi_modal         whether to use multimodal information
  --mm_fusion_mthd MM_FUSION_MTHD
                        method to use multimodal information: concat, gated,
                        concat_subsequently
  --modals MODALS       modals to fusion
  --av_using_lstm       whether to use lstm in acoustic and visual modality
  --Deep_GCN_nlayers DEEP_GCN_NLAYERS
                        Deep_GCN_nlayers
  --Dataset DATASET     dataset to train and test
  --use_speaker         whether to use speaker embedding
  --use_modal           whether to use modal embedding
  --norm NORM           NORM type
  --testing             testing
  --num_L NUM_L         num_hyperconvs
  --num_K NUM_K         num_convs
  --seed SEED
  --ckpt_path CKPT_PATH
